{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hexstone","model_identifier":"hexstone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## hexstone\n\nSmall prop, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 16x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.5, y -1.4..1.4, z -1.6..1.5 (size 3.0 x 2.8 x 3.0 u = 9 x 8 x 9 cm).\nHexstone: a dull green pebble (4 cm in the brief; built ~3 u = 8 cm so it reads in the hand) scratched with crude goblin runes; the scratches are thin `glow_rune_*` cubes for a faint green glow. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.4.\n"},"description":"## hexstone\n\nSmall prop, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 16x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.5, y -1.4..1.4, z -1.6..1.5 (size 3.0 x 2.8 x 3.0 u = 9 x 8 x 9 cm).\nHexstone: a dull green pebble (4 cm in the brief; built ~3 u = 8 cm so it reads in the hand) scratched with crude goblin runes; the scratches are thin `glow_rune_*` cubes for a faint green glow. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.4.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"stone","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-1.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,1.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[9,3,12.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,3,15.0,5.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,6,3.0,8.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[3,6,6.0,8.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,3.0,3.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[3,0,6.0,3.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"888c938a-13e3-586c-af47-ae1fd58cdc75"},{"name":"stone_b","box